        const string Json = "[{\"id\": 1611, \"gameType\": \"DEADWEIGHT\", \"title\": \"Dead Weight\", \"description\": \"Curling, with a putter. Die it on the button and knock the others out.\", \"rules\": \"Your putt throws a stone down the ice. A putt that dies in the hole stops on the button; every inch past or short moves it on or back. Rings score 10, 6, 3 and 1 from the button out. Three stones each a round, and they stay where they stop. Hit a stone with pace and it is knocked on, or out of play. Gentle, and you only nudge it. Three rounds, most points wins.\", \"difficulty\": 6, \"putts\": 9, \"distance\": 0, \"multiPlayer\": 3, \"hasLeaderboard\": 0, \"isOnline\": 0, \"gameCat\": \"ARCADE\", \"skills\": \"speed\"}, {\"id\": 1612, \"gameType\": \"SENDIT\", \"title\": \"Send It\", \"description\": \"Putt harder to jump further. Land in the green window. One more bus every round.\", \"rules\": \"The harder you putt, the further the bike jumps. Too soft lands on the buses, too firm flies past the landing ramp. Land in the green window. The gauge under the stage shows the pace it needs. The first round wants a putt that dies in the hole, and each bus adds 1 in past it. Keep it straight: more than about 3 inches off the center of the hole lands crooked. Two lives each.\", \"difficulty\": 6, \"putts\": 0, \"distance\": 0, \"multiPlayer\": 3, \"hasLeaderboard\": 0, \"isOnline\": 0, \"gameCat\": \"ARCADE\", \"skills\": \"speed,angle\"}, {\"id\": 1613, \"gameType\": \"SLINGSHOT\", \"title\": \"Slingshot\", \"description\": \"A gravity puzzle. Line sets the start, pace the speed. Bend it round to the relay.\", \"rules\": \"Each putt launches the probe straight across from the rail on the left. Get it into the green relay ring on the right. Where the putt crosses the hole sets where on the rail it starts: left of center starts higher, right of center starts lower. Pace is speed. Planets pull the probe toward them: slow putts bend a lot, firm putts bend a little. Fewest putts wins.\", \"difficulty\": 4, \"putts\": 0, \"distance\": 0, \"multiPlayer\": 3, \"hasLeaderboard\": 0, \"isOnline\": 0, \"gameCat\": \"ARCADE\", \"skills\": \"angle,speed\"}, {\"id\": 1614, \"gameType\": \"SPOTKICK\", \"title\": \"Spot Kick\", \"description\": \"A penalty shootout. Line aims it, pace lifts it. The keeper learns your habits.\", \"rules\": \"Hole the putt and the kick is on target. Miss left or right and it goes wide on that side. Leave it short and it rolls to the keeper. Where the ball enters the cup is where the kick goes: the left edge of the cup is the left side of the goal. A firmer putt flies higher. The keeper dives where your last kicks went, so change sides. Top corners count double.\", \"difficulty\": 4, \"putts\": 5, \"distance\": 0, \"multiPlayer\": 3, \"hasLeaderboard\": 0, \"isOnline\": 0, \"gameCat\": \"ARCADE\", \"skills\": \"angle,speed\"}, {\"id\": 1615, \"gameType\": \"TUGOFWAR\", \"title\": \"Tug of War\", \"description\": \"Two teams, one rope, one mud pit. Every putt hauls the flag your way.\", \"rules\": \"Teams take turns, and partners take turns within a team. Reach the hole and the flag comes 1 step your way. Lip out: 2 steps. Hole it: 3 steps. Every putt is from a new distance and tee. Leave it short and your team slips: the flag moves 1 step the other way. The flag starts in the middle. Pull it 5 steps to your line to win the round. Best of three rounds, and the losing team starts the next one.\", \"difficulty\": 2, \"putts\": 0, \"distance\": 0, \"multiPlayer\": 3, \"hasLeaderboard\": 0, \"isOnline\": 0, \"gameCat\": \"ARCADE\", \"skills\": \"distance\"}, {\"id\": 1616, \"gameType\": \"TURFWAR\", \"title\": \"Turf War\", \"description\": \"Two teams, one white floor. Your putt throws the paint. Most floor covered wins.\", \"rules\": \"Teams take turns throwing paint, 8 putts a side. The floor is the mat from above: the paint lands where your ball finished. Short and left lands near and on the left; firm lands far. Paint covers paint: splat over the other team to take their floor. Hole it and the splat is three times the size. A putt that stops short lands where it stopped; one that runs past lands where it would have finished. Most floor covered at the end wins.\", \"difficulty\": 2, \"putts\": 8, \"distance\": 0, \"multiPlayer\": 3, \"hasLeaderboard\": 0, \"isOnline\": 0, \"gameCat\": \"ARCADE\", \"skills\": \"speed,angle\"}, {\"id\": 1617, \"gameType\": \"UNDERTHECUP\", \"title\": \"Under the Cup\", \"description\": \"A pin table under the hole. Run the middle untouched for the hundred.\", \"rules\": \"Hole the putt and the ball drops onto a pin table under the cup. Pockets along the bottom score 10 to 100. The 100 is in the middle. A ball that reaches the middle without touching a pin scores the 100. If it touched one on the way it scores 60.\", \"difficulty\": 4, \"putts\": 10, \"distance\": 0, \"multiPlayer\": 3, \"hasLeaderboard\": 0, \"isOnline\": 0, \"gameCat\": \"ARCADE\", \"skills\": \"angle,speed\"}, {\"id\": 1618, \"gameType\": \"WINDMILL\", \"title\": \"Windmill\", \"description\": \"Crazy golf, six holes. Pace sets the distance, line bends it. Fewest strokes wins.\", \"rules\": \"Six holes, and every Player plays a hole out before the next. Each putt is one stroke, and the ball plays on from where it stops. Putt from the distance on screen. Inside 11 feet it is the real putt: make it and it drops, miss and it rolls out just as far and as wide as it did on the mat. Longer, putt a quarter of the way: the miss is scaled back up. Under 3 feet is a gimme for one stroke. Water costs a stroke, a blade sends it back, five strokes is the most. Fewest wins.\", \"difficulty\": 4, \"putts\": 0, \"distance\": 0, \"multiPlayer\": 3, \"hasLeaderboard\": 0, \"isOnline\": 0, \"gameCat\": \"ARCADE\", \"skills\": \"speed,angle\"}, {\"id\": 1619, \"gameType\": \"PUTTBALL\", \"title\": \"Putt-ball\", \"description\": \"Real skee-ball. The bullseye is the hole. The back corners are worth 100.\", \"rules\": \"Each putt rolls a ball up the lane and off the hop. The board is your Puttr's ramp: the ball lands where your putt went. The bullseye is the hole: a make is 40. Short of the hole lands in the lower rings, and a make hit too firm carries past the 40 and falls back into a lower ring. A miss that runs to the back of the mat lands at the top of the board: just past the edge of the cup finds the 50, and the back corners are worth 100. Nine balls each, most points wins.\", \"difficulty\": 4, \"putts\": 9, \"distance\": 0, \"multiPlayer\": 3, \"hasLeaderboard\": 0, \"isOnline\": 0, \"gameCat\": \"ARCADE\", \"skills\": \"speed,angle\"}]";

